OL,3,GNEWSAHuman bones found during bandstand
OL,4,Arenovation 'are from teaching skeleton'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuman bones uncovered during renovation
OL,7,Fwork on a bandstand in Ayr are believed
OL,8,Fto be from a teaching skeleton, BBC
OL,9,FScotland News understands.
OL,11,FThe discovery were made during work at
OL,12,Fthe Place de Saint-Germain-en-Laye
OL,13,Fbandstand in the town.
OL,15,FA picture sent to BBC Scotland News
OL,16,Fshowed several bones lying on the
OL,17,Fground at the site, having earlier been
OL,18,Ffound by workmen.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
