OL,3,GNEWSAHuman bones found during bandstand
OL,4,Arenovation 'are from teaching skeleton'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland later attended to
OL,7,Fremove the bones and renovation work
OL,8,Fhas resumed. An expert assessment is
OL,9,Fbelieved to have confirmed the bones
OL,10,Fwere part of an anatomical teaching
OL,11,Fskeleton, buried at the site in the
OL,12,Fpast.
